List downloaded models (--all for the catalog)

Usage: wally models list [OPTIONS]

Options:
  -h, --help                  Show help
  -a, --all                   Every local catalog model, plus your account's
                              cloud models
      --local                 Every local catalog model, without cloud models
      --cloud                 Only your account's cloud models

Examples:
  # Browse the whole catalog
  wally models list --all
